      "created_at": "2026-01-08T06:23:48.355Z",
      "cooked": "<ul>\n<li>You can identify rate based on the Tax Withholding Category.</li>\n<li>To configure different TDS rates for different suppliers by creating different Tax Withholding Category.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>In v16, there are some changes.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>TDS Details are available at the doc level.</li>\n<li>You can specify a different rate for the same tax withholding category using the tax withholding group.</li>\n</ul>",
